From: M2 Gate Closure Audit <audit@local>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 17:38:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(H3.2): simulated annealing finds a lattice with
 density >= 0.60

H3.2 (empirical): best-of-five SA seeds should reach density >= 0.60,
median >= 0.55.

Anomaly caught and fixed before any seed result was trusted: under an
earlier soft-weighted clearance penalty (superseded before this commit),
seed 0 reported density 0.8663 at a clearance of -0.00184 -- above the
milestone's 0.75 anomaly-watch threshold, with a reported clearance that
was itself negative despite the objective supposedly penalising exactly
that. Per the milestone's explicit instruction (materialise before
believing it), materialised this basis and ran it through the real
reference/evaluator.py directly: 163 real overlapping pairs. The same
0.877-vs-0.327 failure story the milestone doc describes, reproduced for
real. Fixed by replacing the soft-weighted penalty with a hard feasibility
barrier (see _objective), so no clearance violation can ever be traded for
a density gain -- the underlying scale bug itself was fixed in the
preceding fix(H3.1) commit.

Measured (five seeds, each timed and stored independently per the
docs(M3) wall-clock decision, in a new artifacts/lattice_runs/ store since
the per-configuration ledger schema doesn't fit a lattice-search run):

  seed 0: density 0.693730, clearance 0.0014072, wall_clock_s 58.34
  seed 1: density 0.622670, clearance 0.0045595, wall_clock_s 35.17
  seed 2: density 0.669979, clearance 0.0093751, wall_clock_s 42.84
  seed 3: density 0.552120, clearance 0.0021190, wall_clock_s 35.58
  seed 4: density 0.725241, clearance 0.0000014, wall_clock_s 43.89

Best-of-five 0.725241 (seed 4), median 0.669979 -- both clear the
falsification floor and predicted targets. Seed 4's unusually tight
clearance margin got the same anomaly-watch scrutiny as the caught defect
above: independently materialised on a larger 9x9 patch and cross-checked
against reference/evaluator.py directly. Zero overlaps; confirmed genuine.

Full Gate green: ruff format/check, mypy (30 files), lint-imports, pytest.
